      "noFooter": true,
      "content": "<div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:56px;width:100%;'><p class='h1 ink' style='max-width:820px;'>Seu atendimento no WhatsApp começa agora.</p><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;'><p class='body-md ink' style='opacity:0.45;'>Integração nativa. API Oficial da Meta.</p><p style='font-family:\"Bricolage Grotesque\",sans-serif;font-size:52px;font-weight:800;color:#13111E;letter-spacing:-0.04em;line-height:1;'>citra.chat/whatsapp</p></div></div>"
